rxscene 1

# Mid-rise ribbon-window office: wide bays, strong horizontal banding, a glazed
# ground floor and a cornice. The cornice is the cheapest thing in this whole
# directory and does the most work - a mid-rise that stops dead at its top edge
# reads as a cut-off box, and 40cm of overhang is the difference.

